<title>USA: Digital Equipment unveils desktop designs.</title>
<headline>Digital Equipment unveils desktop designs.</headline>
<dateline>MAYNARD, Mass. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Equipment Corp said Tuesday its next generation of desktop systems incorporate design features announced recently by Intel Corp.</p>
<p>Intel recently announced its new motherboard form factor, NLX, extending ease of serviceability and upgradeability to an industry-standard desktop design, a statement from Digital said.</p>
</text>
